      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "public class FlyWithWings implements FlyBehavior {\n    public void fly() {\n        System.out.println(\"I'm flying with wings!\");\n    }\n}\n// FlyWithWings is a class that implements the FlyBehavior interface and provides an implementation for the fly() method\n// The implementation of fly() in FlyWithWings prints \"I'm flying with wings!\" to the console",
